# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0022 (Specific capabilities added)
# CoreDNS runs as a non-root user (65532) and requires NET_BIND_SERVICE to listen on DNS port 53
KSV-0022
AVD-KSV-0022

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0037 (User resources should not be placed in kube-system namespace)
# CoreDNS is the core Kubernetes cluster DNS infrastructure and appropriately resides in the kube-system namespace
KSV-0037
AVD-KSV-0037

# https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/ksv-0117 (Prevent binding to privileged ports)
# CoreDNS is the cluster DNS server (kube-dns) and must bind to privileged port 53 for DNS resolution
KSV-0117
AVD-KSV-0117
